45.974" end="46.321">線</span><span begin="46.321" end="46.636">を</span><span begin="46.636" end="46.933">走</span><span begin="46.933" end="47.066">り</span><span begin="47.066" end="47.273">抜</span><span begin="47.273" end="47.462">け</span><span begin="47.462" end="47.942">て</span> <span begin="48.307" end="48.635">東</span><span begin="48.635" end="49.066">奔</span><span begin="49.066" end="49.450">西</span><span begin="49.450" end="49.833">走</span><span begin="49.833" end="49.978">な</span><span begin="49.978" end="50.276">ん</span><span begin="50.276" end="50.452">の</span><span begin="50.452" end="50.592">そ</span><span begin="50.592" end="51.295">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">环状线上一穿而过 东奔西走 那又怎样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kanjō sen o hashirinuke te tōhonseisō nannosono</span></p><p begin="51.387" end="57.107" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.387" end="51.775">少</span><span begin="51.775" end="52.185">年</span><span begin="52.185" end="52.538">少</span><span begin="52.538" end="52.917">女</span><span begin="52.917" end="53.129">戦</span><span begin="53.129" end="53.348">国</span><span begin="53.348" end="53.535">無</span><span begin="53.535" end="54.096">双</span> <span begin="54.096" end="54.503">浮</span><span begin="54.503" end="54.626">世</span><span begin="54.626" end="55.185">の</span><span begin="55.185" end="56.096">随</span><span begin="56.096" end="57.107">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">少年少女 战国无双 随这浮世流转</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shōnen shōjo sengoku musō ukiyo no zui ni</span></p><p begin="57.380" end="1:03.369" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.380" end="57.633">千</span><span begin="57.633" end="57.926">本</span><span begin="57.926" end="59.008">桜</span> <span begin="59.008" end="59.333">夜</span><span begin="59.333" end="59.523">ニ</span><span begin="59.523" end="59.943">紛</span><span begin="59.943" end="1:00.323">レ</span> <span begin="1:00.323" end="1:00.730">君</span><span begin="1:00.730" end="1:00.971">ノ</span><span begin="1:00.971" end="1:01.493">声</span><span begin="1:01.493" end="1:02.088">モ</span><span begin="1:02.088" end="1:02.445">届</span><span begin="1:02.445" end="1:02.641">カ</span><span begin="1:02.641" end="1:02.830">ナ</span><span begin="1:02.830" end="1:03.042">イ</span><span begin="1:03.042" end="1:03.369">ヨ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">千本樱散 隐入夜里 你的声音 传不到此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sembon sakura yoru ni magi re kimi no koe mo todoke kanaiyo</span></p><p begin="1:03.488" end="1:09.596" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.488" end="1:03.607">此</span><span begin="1:03.607" end="1:03.824">処</span><span begin="1:03.824" end="1:04.041">は</span><span begin="1:04.041" end="1:05.224">宴</span> <span begin="1:05.224" end="1:05.780">鋼</span><span begin="1:05.780" end="1:06.187">の</span><span begin="1:06.187" end="1:06.561">檻</span> <span begin="1:06.561" end="1:06.855">そ</span><span begin="1:06.855" end="1:07.090">の</span><span begin="1:07.090" end="1:07.422">断</span><span begin="1:07.422" end="1:07.793">頭</span><span begin="1:07.793" end="1:08.185">台</span><span begin="1:08.185" end="1:08.626">で</span><span begin="1:08.626" end="1:08.871">見</span><span begin="1:08.871" end="1:09.050">下</span><span begin="1:09.050" end="1:09.207">ろ</span><span begin="1:09.207" end="1:09.389">し</span><span begin="1:09.389" end="1:09.596">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此处便是 宴钢牢笼 在那断头台 俯视众生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">koko wa utage hagane no ori sono dantō dai de mioroshi te</span></p><p begin="1:09.665" end="1:15.770" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.665" end="1:10.148">三</span><span begin="1:10.148" end="1:10.430">千</span><span begin="1:10.430" end="1:10.649">世</span><span begin="1:10.649" end="1:11.441">界</span> <span begin="1:11.441" end="1:11.777">常</span><span begin="1:11.777" end="1:12.008">世</span><span begin="1:12.008" end="1:12.206">之</span><span begin="1:12.206" end="1:12.845">闇</span> <span begin="1:12.845" end="1:13.175">嘆</span><span begin="1:13.175" end="1:13.388">ク</span><span begin="1:13.388" end="1:13.988">唄</span><span begin="1:13.988" end="1:14.555">モ</span><span begin="1:14.555" end="1:14.726">聞</span><span begin="1:14.726" end="1:14.918">コ</span><span begin="1:14.918" end="1:15.111">エ</span><span begin="1:15.111" end="1:15.299">ナ</span><span begin="1:15.299" end="1:15.518">イ</span><span begin="1:15.518" end="1:15.770">ヨ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">三千世界 常世暗幽 叹惋之歌 也听不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sanzensekai tokoyo no yami nage ku uta mo ki koenaiyo</span></p><p begin="1:15.916" end="1:22.817" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.916" end="1:16.295">青</span><span begin="1:16.295" end="1:16.483">藍</span><span begin="1:16.483" end="1:16.844">の</span><span begin="1:16.844" end="1:17.656">空</span> <span begin="1:17.656" end="1:18.050">遥</span><span begin="1:18.050" end="1:18.236">か</span><span begin="1:18.236" end="1:18.653">彼</span><span begin="1:18.653" end="1:19.055">方</span> <span begin="1:19.055" end="1:19.226">そ</span><span begin="1:19.226" end="1:19.442">の</span><span begin="1:19.442" end="1:19.852">光</span><span begin="1:19.852" end="1:20.189">線</span><span begin="1:20.189" end="1:20.594">銃</span><span begin="1:20.594" end="1:20.948">で</span><span begin="1:20.948" end="1:21.149">打</span><span begin="1:21.149" end="1:21.362">ち</span><span begin="1:21.362" end="1:21.563">抜</span><span begin="1:21.563" end="1:21.737">い</span><span begin="1:21.737" end="1:22.817">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">蔚蓝天空 遥远方 以光线枪 一击射穿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ao ai no sora haruka kanata sono kōsen jū de uchinui te</span></p><p begin="1:34.982" end="1:38.062" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.982" end="1:35.422">百</span><span begin="1:35.422" end="1:35.770">戦</span><span begin="1:35.770" end="1:36.155">錬</span><span begin="1:36.155" end="1:36.340">磨</span><span begin="1:36.340" end="1:36.553">の</span><span begin="1:36.553" end="1:36.827">見</span><span begin="1:36.827" end="1:36.938">た</span><span begin="1:36.938" end="1:37.228">目</span><span begin="1:37.228" end="1:37.381">は</span><span begin="1:37.381" end="1:37.747">将</span><span begin="1:37.747" end="1:38.062">校</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">百战锻练 容貌似将校</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hyakusenremma no mitame wa shōkō</span></p><p begin="1:38.139" end="1:41.230" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.139" end="1:38.472">いっ</span><span begin="1:38.472" end="1:38.746">た</span><span begin="1:38.746" end="1:38.884">り</span><span begin="1:38.884" end="1:39.082">き</span><span begin="1:39.082" end="1:39.271">た</span><span begin="1:39.271" end="1:39.478">り</span><span begin="1:39.478" end="1:39.715">の</span><span begin="1:39.715" end="1:40.108">花</span><span begin="1:40.108" end="1:40.483">魁</span><span begin="1:40.483" end="1:40.849">道</span><span begin="1:40.849" end="1:41.230">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">花魁行列 往复巡游</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ittari ki tari no oiran dōchū</span></p><p begin="1:41.296" end="1:44.395" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.296" end="1:41.428">ア</span><span begin="1:41.428" end="1:41.626">イ</span><span begin="1:41.626" end="1:41.890">ツ</span><span begin="1:41.890" end="1:42.028">も</span><span begin="1:42.028" end="1:42.193">コ</span><span begin="1:42.193" end="1:42.364">イ</span><span begin="1:42.364" end="1:42.585">ツ</span><span begin="1:42.585" end="1:42.784">も</span><span begin="1:42.784" end="1:43.507">皆</span><span begin="1:43.507" end="1:43.643">で</span><span begin="1:43.643" end="1:43.964">集</span><span begin="1:43.964" end="1:44.164">ま</span><span begin="1:44.164" end="1:44.395">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不论你我 全都聚来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">aitsu mo koitsu mo mina de atsumare</span></p><p begin="1:44.513" end="1:47.441" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.513" end="1:44.792">聖</span><span begin="1:44.792" end="1:44.988">者</span><span begin="1:44.988" end="1:45.156">の</span><span begin="1:45.156" end="1:45.531">行</span><span begin="1:45.531" end="1:45.903">進</span> <span begin="1:45.903" end="1:46.050">わ</span><span begin="1:46.050" end="1:46.320">んっ</span><span begin="1:46.320" end="1:46.692">つー</span><span begin="1:46.692" end="1:46.824">さ</span><span begin="1:46.824" end="1:47.088">ん</span><span begin="1:47.088" end="1:47.441">しっ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">圣者行进 一二三四</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">seija no kōshin wan tsu tsu ー san shitsu</span></p><p begin="1:47.522" end="1:53.478" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.522" end="1:47.931">禅</span><span begin="1:47.931" end="1:48.297">定</span><span begin="1:48.297" end="1:48.656">門</span><span begin="1:48.656" end="1:49.023">を</span><span begin="1:49.023" end="1:49.223">潜</span><span begin="1:49.223" end="1:49.368">り</span><span begin="1:49.368" end="1:49.635">抜</span><span begin="1:49.635" end="1:49.826">け</span><span begin="1:49.826" end="1:50.649">て</span> <span begin="1:50.649" end="1:50.997">安</span><span begin="1:50.997" end="1:51.384">楽</span><span begin="1:51.384" end="1:51.795">浄</span><span begin="1:51.795" end="1:52.161">土</span><span begin="1:52.161" end="1:52.524">厄</span><span begin="1:52.524" end="1:52.932">払</span><span begin="1:52.932" end="1:53.478">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">潜过禅定门 安乐净土 消灾驱厄</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zenjō mon o kuguri nuke te anrakujōdo yakuharai</span></p><p begin="1:53.714" end="1:59.436" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.714" end="1:54.146">きっ</span><span begin="1:54.146" end="1:54.479">と</span>